\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  likely  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 fx \highlight\uc2  market after last Monday -sources\b0\par\par\uc2 423 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2011\par 04:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * BOJ likely conducted "stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " after Mon -sources\par \par \uc2 * Persistent bids detected at around 77.80 yen last week\par \par \uc2 * BOJ data suggests amount of any stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  small\par \par \uc2 * Dollar/yen now 3.7 pct above record low\par \par \uc2 (Adds latest BOJ data, background)\par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Nov 7 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  stealthily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during the previous week even after its record yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Monday, market sources told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 They said trading evidence showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , albeit in small amounts, since Monday, when \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent an estimated 7.7 trillion yen ($98.5 billion), a daily record for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to curb the yen's strength.\par \par \uc2 The dollar has since been mostly supported above 78 yen and traders said there were persistent bids around 77.80 yen last week, which helped prop up the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The yen has risen as the greenback has come under pressure from expectations of more easing by the Federal Reserve while the euro has been bruised by the debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was last trading around 78.13 yen , about 3.7 percent above a record low of 75.31 yen hit on Oct. 31 just before Japanese authorities stepped into the market.\par \par \uc2 That contrasts with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's previous unilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Aug. 4, when the dollar jumped more than 4 percent only to completely erase gains in just three days.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Jun Azumi told parliament on Wednesday that it was not the time to review the impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- a comment some market players took to mean that he was still keen to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities said last Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was prompted by the need to take measures against speculative market moves, with Finance Minister Azumi saying authorities would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  until they were satisfied.\par \par \uc2 But officials have since declined to comment on whether they are continuing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market data since then does not show any large unusual payment from the government to banks after Monday, suggesting any additional \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have been small in size.\par \par \uc2 If confirmed, Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would surpass the record 4.5 trillion yen of yen-selling conducted on Aug. 4.\par \par \uc2 Full details of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in this quarter will be published in mid-February. ($1 = 78.180 Japanese Yen)\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Tokyo Markets Team; Editing by Edwina Gibbs and Joseph Radford)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020111110e7b700050\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
