 dollar to Y79.55 from around Y75.65 before the move. The pair stood at Y78.90 as of 0745 GMT, after the yen hit a record high of Y75.31 in early Asian trading Monday.\par \par \uc2 -By David Roman, Dow Jones Newswires, +34 91 395 8127; david.roman@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 31, 2011 04:55 ET (08:55 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020111031e7av002hx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
